@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-validity`
IMPORT `g2-tests-fixtures`

-- g2-tests-validity.l4: tests of section 8 and of "the licence is in force on a day".
-- Every expected value was decided from the words of s 8 and of Interpretation Law s 10(b) BEFORE any module was run
-- (dates by the Python calendar in work/g2/oracle.py, which is independent of the L4).  A failing assertion is a finding.
-- The expectations of the readings NOT taken are in g2-tests-red.l4.

§ `Tests — section 8: the two limbs of a validity period`

-- s 8: "the validity of a licence shall be five years or until 31 March of the fifth year from the year in which the licence was
-- granted, whichever is earlier".
-- src:100 | {{ח:ת}} תוקפו של רישיון יהיה לחמש שנים או עד 31 במרץ של השנה החמישית מהשנה שבה ניתן הרישיון, לפי המוקדם (להלן – תקופת תוקף), וניתן לחדשו לתקופות תוקף נוספות בהתקיים התנאים לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף 6}}, למעט התנאי לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף קטן (א)(4) של אותו סעיף}}.

-- Grant on 1.2.2026: five years end 1.2.2031 (IL s 10(b)); the 31 March of the fifth year from 2026 (2031) is later: limb 1 governs.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the five year limb of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
#ASSERT `s 8 — the 31 March limb of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
-- Grant on 1.6.2026: 31 March 2031 comes before 1.6.2031: limb 2 governs.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the five year limb of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 6 1
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- Grant on 31.3.2026: the limbs tie on 31.3.2031.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 3 31) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- Grant on 30.3.2026: limb 1 is a day earlier; grant on 1.4.2026: limb 2 is a day earlier.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 3 30) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 30
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 4 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- Grant on 29.2.2024: five years after ends on the last day of February 2029 (IL s 10(b)), not 1 March.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the five year limb of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2029 2 28
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2029 2 28
-- Grant on 31.12.2026: limb 2 governs, and by a long way.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 12 31) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- Grant on 15.1.2025 (a Wednesday): limb 1 ends Tuesday 15.1.2030.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2025 1 15) EQUALS YMD 2030 1 15

-- Fork FV1 (trap T24), the alternative: the year of grant counted as the first year, so the fifth year is year of grant plus four.
-- Then limb 2 is always the earlier and limb 1 never governs: the alternative's answer for a grant on 1.2.2026 is 31.3.2030.
#ASSERT `s 8 (the year of grant counted as the first year) — the 31 March limb of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2030 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 (the year of grant counted as the first year) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2030 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 (the year of grant counted as the first year) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2030 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 (the year of grant counted as the first year) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2025 1 15) EQUALS YMD 2029 3 31
-- The two readings differ on every grant: limb 1 can govern only under year plus five.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS `s 8 (the year of grant counted as the first year) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1))

-- Fork FV2 (kind V), the alternative: Interpretation Law s 10(c) applied to the five year limb.  1.2.2031 is a Saturday.
-- Saturday and Sunday rest: the end moves to Monday 3.2.2031.  Only Saturday rest: it moves to Sunday 2.2.2031 (not a rest day in that calendar).
-- No rest days: unchanged.  Where limb 2 governs (a grant on 1.6.2026) the date limb is not a period and (c) does not act.
GIVETH A `Calendar of rest days`
`a calendar of Saturday and Sunday 1 and 2 February 2031` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST (YMD 2031 2 1), (YMD 2031 2 2)

GIVETH A `Calendar of rest days`
`a calendar of Saturday 1 February 2031 only` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST (YMD 2031 2 1)

GIVETH A `Calendar of rest days`
`a calendar of no rest days` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS EMPTY

GIVETH A `Calendar of rest days`
`a calendar with Monday 31 March 2031` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST (YMD 2031 3 31)

#ASSERT `s 8 (Interpretation Law s 10(c) applied to the five year limb) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, with` `a calendar of Saturday and Sunday 1 and 2 February 2031` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 3
#ASSERT `s 8 (Interpretation Law s 10(c) applied to the five year limb) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, with` `a calendar of Saturday 1 February 2031 only` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 2
#ASSERT `s 8 (Interpretation Law s 10(c) applied to the five year limb) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, with` `a calendar of no rest days` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
#ASSERT `s 8 (Interpretation Law s 10(c) applied to the five year limb) — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a calendar with Monday 31 March 2031` EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- The reading taken (no (c)) gives 1.2.2031 whatever the calendar.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of the validity period beginning on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1

§ `Tests — section 8 and the register: the licence's last day of validity`

GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026` MEANS `an ordinary grade 1 licence granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1)

-- FV3.  A licence renewed on 15.6.2030: TAKEN each renewal begins a validity period counted from the renewal day:
-- five years after 15.6.2030 is 15.6.2035, 31 March 2035 is earlier, so the last day is 31.3.2035.
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` (LIST (YMD 2030 6 15)) `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030 and 10.4.2035` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` (LIST (YMD 2030 6 15), (YMD 2035 4 10)) `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 with its renewals listed out of order` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` (LIST (YMD 2035 4 10), (YMD 2030 6 15)) `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` EQUALS YMD 2035 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030 and 10.4.2035` EQUALS YMD 2040 3 31
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 with its renewals listed out of order` EQUALS YMD 2040 3 31
-- The latest of the grant day and the renewal days, by comparison.
#ASSERT `the latest of the grant day and the renewal days` (YMD 2026 2 1) (LIST (YMD 2035 4 10), (YMD 2030 6 15)) EQUALS YMD 2035 4 10
#ASSERT `the latest of the grant day and the renewal days` (YMD 2026 2 1) EMPTY EQUALS YMD 2026 2 1

-- FV3, the alternative: each further period continues from the day after the previous one ends.
-- After 1 renewal: the first period ends 1.2.2031, the next begins 2.2.2031 and ends 2.2.2036 (limb 1; 31.3.2036 is later).
-- After 2 renewals: the second ends 2.2.2036, the third begins 3.2.2036 and ends 3.2.2041.
#ASSERT `s 8 (each further period continues from the end of the previous one) — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
#ASSERT `s 8 (each further period continues from the end of the previous one) — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` EQUALS YMD 2036 2 2
#ASSERT `s 8 (each further period continues from the end of the previous one) — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030 and 10.4.2035` EQUALS YMD 2041 2 3
#ASSERT `s 8 (each further period continues from the end of the previous one) — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2036 2 2)
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2035 4 1)
#ASSERT `s 8 — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and renewed on 15.6.2030` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2035 3 31)

-- FV5.  The register's recorded last day governs where there is one (an extension under s 17(c) is carried that way).
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (YMD 2031 4 30)) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` EQUALS YMD 2031 4 30
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence, by the Law alone` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` EQUALS YMD 2031 2 1
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` (YMD 2031 4 30)
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 (the Law alone) — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2031 4 30)
#ASSERT `s 8 (the Law alone) — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 whose register records 30.4.2031` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2031 2 1)

§ `Tests — section 8 and the register: in force on a day`

-- From the grant day (inclusive) to the last day (inclusive): 1.2.2026 to 1.2.2031.
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` (YMD 2026 1 31)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` (YMD 2026 2 1)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` (YMD 2031 2 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` (YMD 2031 2 2)
-- FV4, the alternative: validity begins the day after the grant.
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 (validity begins the day after the grant) — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2026 2 1)
#ASSERT `s 8 (validity begins the day after the grant) — the licence` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026` `is within its period of validity on` (YMD 2026 2 2)

-- A temporary licence (s 9): the Law fixes no last day (the Registrar sets the term), so the register's last day is needed.
GIVETH A Licence
`a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 recorded to end 31.1.2027` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 3 licence` `, temporary being` TRUE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (YMD 2027 1 31)) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

GIVETH A Licence
`a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 with no recorded end` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 3 licence` `, temporary being` TRUE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 recorded to end 31.1.2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 1 31
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 recorded to end 31.1.2027` (YMD 2027 1 31)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 recorded to end 31.1.2027` (YMD 2027 2 1)
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 with no recorded end`
#ASSERT REFUSED `the licence is in force on` `a temporary licence granted on 1.2.2026 with no recorded end` (YMD 2026 6 1)

-- FV6.  Revocation and suspension as the register records them (s 10, group G1).  TAKEN: not in force from the recorded day.
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` (JUST (YMD 2028 5 1)) `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 to 31.3.2027` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` (JUST (YMD 2027 1 1)) `, suspended until` (JUST (YMD 2027 3 31))

GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 until final judgment` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` (JUST (YMD 2027 1 1)) `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` (YMD 2028 4 30)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` (YMD 2028 5 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` (YMD 2028 5 2)
-- FV6, the alternative: a revocation takes effect the day after the day recorded.
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on, a revocation or suspension taking effect the day after` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` (YMD 2028 5 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on, a revocation or suspension taking effect the day after` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and revoked on 1.5.2028` (YMD 2028 5 2)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 to 31.3.2027` (YMD 2026 12 31)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 to 31.3.2027` (YMD 2027 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 to 31.3.2027` (YMD 2027 3 31)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 to 31.3.2027` (YMD 2027 4 1)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 until final judgment` (YMD 2026 12 31)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 until final judgment` (YMD 2028 6 1)
#ASSERT `the licence is in force on, a revocation or suspension taking effect the day after` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 until final judgment` (YMD 2027 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on, a revocation or suspension taking effect the day after` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and suspended from 1.1.2027 until final judgment` (YMD 2027 1 2)

-- IP1: the kinds of licence in force on a day, among a person's licences.
GIVETH A LIST OF Licence
`three licences of one person` MEANS
    LIST (`an ordinary licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1))
       , (`an ordinary licence of kind` `grade 2 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2020 1 1))
       , (`a licence of kind` `grade 3 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` NOTHING `, revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 12 1)) `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING)

-- The grade 2 licence granted 1.1.2020 ended 1.1.2025 (limb 1; 31.3.2025 is later); the grade 3 licence was revoked 1.12.2026.
#ASSERT `the licence kinds in force on the day` (YMD 2026 6 1) `three licences of one person` EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `the licence kinds in force on the day` (YMD 2027 1 1) `three licences of one person` EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`
#ASSERT `the licence kinds in force on the day` (YMD 2019 12 31) `three licences of one person` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the licence kinds in force on the day` (YMD 2020 6 1) `three licences of one person` EQUALS LIST `grade 2 licence`

§ `Tests — section 17(c) read with section 8 (trap T25)`

-- s 17(c): an extension "not exceeding three months".  Three months after an event on 1.2.2031 end on 1.5.2031 (IL s 10(b)).
-- TAKEN: not capped by the 31 March limb (the period that began 1.2.2026 has 31.3.2031 as its limb 2).
#ASSERT `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 3 `months` EQUALS YMD 2031 5 1
#ASSERT `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 1 `months` EQUALS YMD 2031 3 1
#ASSERT `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 3 31) `extended by` 3 `months` EQUALS YMD 2031 6 30
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 0 `months`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 4 `months`
-- The alternative: capped at the 31 March limb of the period that began on the given day.
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (capped at the 31 March limb) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 3 `months, the period having begun on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (capped at the 31 March limb) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 1 `months, the period having begun on` (YMD 2026 2 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 1
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (capped at the 31 March limb) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 3 31) `extended by` 3 `months, the period having begun on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 3 31
-- The licence in force on 1 April 2031 for the case of 1.2.2026 extended by three months: in force on the extension taken, not on the cap.
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended by three months under section 17(c)` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (`s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 3 `months`)) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended by three months under section 17(c)` (YMD 2031 4 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended by three months under section 17(c)` (YMD 2031 5 2)

-- D2 (2026-10-14): a part of a month.  s 17(c) allows an extension "not exceeding three months", so half a month is within it; the months form takes whole
-- months only (Interpretation Law s 10(b) fixes the last day of a period of months only for whole months) and refuses the others, naming the day form.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 0.5 `months`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 1.5 `months`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 2.5 `months`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 3.5 `months`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` (0 MINUS 1) `months`
#ASSERT `s 17(c) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended by` 2 `months` EQUALS YMD 2031 4 1
-- The day form: any day after the last day of validity, up to the last day of three months after it (1.2.2031 + 3 months = 1.5.2031).
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 2 15) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 15
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 2 2) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 2
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 5 1) EQUALS YMD 2031 5 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 5 2)
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 2 1)
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 1 31)
-- From a last day on the 31st the three months end on the 30th (IL s 10(b), the shorter month): 31.3.2031 + 3 months = 30.6.2031.
#ASSERT `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 3 31) `extended to` (YMD 2031 6 30) EQUALS YMD 2031 6 30
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 3 31) `extended to` (YMD 2031 7 1)
-- A licence whose register records a half-month extension: in force on its last day, not after it.
GIVETH A Licence
`a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended to 15.2.2031 under section 17(c)` MEANS
    `a licence of kind` `grade 1 licence` `, temporary being` FALSE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (`s 17(c) (to a stated day) — the last day of validity` (YMD 2031 2 1) `extended to` (YMD 2031 2 15))) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING

#ASSERT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended to 15.2.2031 under section 17(c)` (YMD 2031 2 15)
#ASSERT NOT `the licence is in force on` `a licence granted on 1.2.2026 and extended to 15.2.2031 under section 17(c)` (YMD 2031 2 16)
